{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{% block title %}Réglages — {{ asset.name }} — {{ site_name }}{% endblock %}
{#
  One asset's own settings: what a visitor may ask for, what it costs, and
  what is expected up front.

  These three blocks used to live on "Espace chefs d'U > Locations" at
  `role_min: admin`, which made a chief d'unité the only person able to price
  a hall somebody else actually runs. They belong here, with the bookings, the
  documents and the stay — reachable by the asset's managers, who the module
  has always said are not necessarily chiefs (§6.3). Unit staff reach them the
  same way, as implicit managers of every asset, rather than through a second
  screen of their own.

  Anchors rather than tabs, like the page they came from: every section still
  renders, so Ctrl-F and a printed page keep working.
#}
{% block content %}
    <div class="container py-4" style="max-width: 1100px;">
        <h1 class="h3 mb-1">{{ asset.name }}</h1>
        <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-3">Réglages du bien</p>

        {% include '@rental/management/_nav.html.twig' %}

        {% if asset.isArchived %}
            <div class="alert alert-warning">
                Ce bien est archivé : il n'apparaît plus publiquement et n'accepte plus de nouvelle
                réservation. Ces réglages restent modifiables pour clôturer l'historique en cours.
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        <p class="text-body-secondary small">
            Ces réglages sont ceux du bien, pas ceux d'une réservation. Les modifier ne change
            <strong>aucune réservation existante</strong> : le prix annoncé à un visiteur est figé
            au moment de sa demande, et le prix convenu au moment de l'accord.
        </p>

        <nav class="mb-4" aria-label="Sections des réglages">
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="#regles">Règles de réservation</a>
                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="#tarification">Tarification</a>
                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="#paiements">Acompte, solde et caution</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        {% include '@rental/management/_constraints.html.twig' %}

        {% include '@rental/management/_pricing.html.twig' %}

        {% include '@rental/management/_payments.html.twig' %}
    </div>
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
    {# type="module" — the file uses `export`, and a classic <script> tag
       rejects it with a SyntaxError before a line of it runs. #}
    <script type="module" src="/assets/js/select-explanation.js"></script>
{% endblock %}
